  "description_en": "Queries the URLs of materials associated with an advanced template for use by the advanced template editor. The URLs expire in 30 minutes. FileList is an array of materials that you want to query. If you do not specify this parameter, the URLs of all materials are returned. A maximum of 400 URLs can be returned",
